commit 357f62005758fb5f44d7aeb74b19787876c53873
Author: cracki <cracki@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 15:03:37 2026 +0330

    feat(qa4-img31,qa4-img30): insight actions in intelligence tabs + robust tour highlight
    
    - img31: every insight row in /market/intelligence now offers actions
      via the existing InsightItemActions (Add to Campaign via
      useUpdateCampaign PATCH context_payload.content_insights cap 20,
      client-side Generate Brief modal/copy). The four renderers expose an
      #item-actions slot whose built-in fallback adds actions for the
      intelligence route while standalone views keep their custom slot
      (ContentOpportunitiesRenderer.vue:86-96,144-151; ContentGapsRenderer
      125-136; ContentMatrixRenderer 139-150; TopPerformingContentRenderer
      104-115).
    - img30: tour targets are waited for (rAF poll up to 2.5s), measured
      only when visible (non-zero rect), re-measured on resize/scroll
      (rAF-throttled), and a hidden/absent target clears the ring instead
      of a collapsed one (useProductTour.ts:94-139, ProductTourOverlay.vue
      48-76,83-95,126-129,197-220). Dismiss persistence unchanged.
    - Renderer tests 6+3+4+4; useProductTour.test.ts 19.

